---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import HomeLogo from '../components/HomeLogo.astro';
import pages from '../data/pages.json';
---
<BaseLayout page={pages["resume"]} bodyClass="resume-page">

    <button
      id="download-resume"
      class="download-button"
      aria-label="Download resume"
      title="Download resume"
    >
      <svg
        width="20"
        height="20"
        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
        fill="none"
        stroke="currentColor"
        stroke-width="2"
        stroke-linecap="round"
        stroke-linejoin="round"
      >
        <path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4" />
        <polyline points="7 10 12 15 17 10" />
        <line x1="12" y1="15" x2="12" y2="3" />
      </svg>
    </button>

    <HomeLogo />

    <main id="content" class="resume-main">
    <div class="resume">
      <header class="resume-header">
        <h1 class="resume-name">Thomas F. Officer</h1>
        <div class="resume-contact">
          <div>Lee, New Hampshire</div>
          <div class="resume-contact-wrapper">
            <span>thomas.officer@gmail.com</span>
            <span class="resume-contact-divider"></span>
            <span>(603) 667-5760</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </header>

      <section class="resume-section">
        <h2 class="resume-section-title">Experience</h2>

        <div class="resume-item">
          <div class="resume-item-header">
            <div class="resume-item-left">
              <h3 class="resume-company">Echo</h3>
              <p class="resume-role">Cofounder, Designer</p>
            </div>
            <time class="resume-date">2023—2025</time>
          </div>
          <ul class="resume-bullets">
            <li>
              Designed and shipped an AI-powered notebook for writers across
              web, iOS, Apple Watch, macOS, and MCP.
            </li>
            <li>
              Conducted user research and implemented an AI-driven process for
              synthesizing that research into product decisions.
            </li>
            <li>
              Used AI to move directly from product concept to production-ready
              pull requests, skipping traditional Figma prototypes.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="resume-item">
          <div class="resume-item-header">
            <div class="resume-item-left">
              <h3 class="resume-company">NetDocuments</h3>
              <p class="resume-role">Principal Product Designer</p>
            </div>
            <time class="resume-date">2021—2023</time>
          </div>
          <ul class="resume-bullets">
            <li>
              Led the integration of Afterpattern in NetDocuments, a mature,
              legacy codebase.
            </li>
            <li>
              Participated in early internal discussions around AI integration
              following the release of ChatGPT.
            </li>
            <li>
              Helped launch the company's first shared UI component library.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="resume-item">
          <div class="resume-item-header">
            <div class="resume-item-left">
              <h3 class="resume-company">Afterpattern</h3>
              <p class="resume-role">Cofounder, Designer</p>
            </div>
            <time class="resume-date">2016—2021</time>
          </div>
          <ul class="resume-bullets">
            <li>
              Led product design from initial concept through acquisition by
              NetDocuments.
            </li>
            <li>
              Led front-end development across web and the Microsoft Word
              add-in.
            </li>
            <li>
              Led user research and contributed to product strategy and roadmap
              as a cofounder.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="resume-item">
          <div class="resume-item-header">
            <div class="resume-item-left">
              <h3 class="resume-company">Blue Ridge Labs @ Robin Hood</h3>
              <p class="resume-role">Design Fellow</p>
            </div>
            <time class="resume-date">2016</time>
          </div>
          <ul class="resume-bullets">
            <li>
              Led user research studying how low-income New Yorkers navigate
              legal problems.
            </li>
            <li>
              Cofounded Afterpattern based on insights uncovered during the
              fellowship.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="resume-section">
        <h2 class="resume-section-title">Education &amp; Certificates</h2>

        <div class="resume-item">
          <div class="resume-item-header">
            <div class="resume-item-left">
              <h3 class="resume-company">How to Build an AI Chatbot</h3>
              <p class="resume-role">Every.to</p>
            </div>
            <time class="resume-date">2023</time>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="resume-item">
          <div class="resume-item-header">
            <div class="resume-item-left">
              <h3 class="resume-company">VR &amp; AR Design</h3>
              <p class="resume-role">MIT xPRO</p>
            </div>
            <time class="resume-date">2023</time>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="resume-item">
          <div class="resume-item-header">
            <div class="resume-item-left">
              <h3 class="resume-company">UX Apprenticeship</h3>
              <p class="resume-role">Thinkful</p>
            </div>
            <time class="resume-date">2016</time>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="resume-item">
          <div class="resume-item-header">
            <div class="resume-item-left">
              <h3 class="resume-company">Vermont Law School</h3>
              <p class="resume-role">Master of Laws (LLM), Magna Cum Laude</p>
            </div>
            <time class="resume-date">2012</time>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="resume-item">
          <div class="resume-item-header">
            <div class="resume-item-left">
              <h3 class="resume-company">
                University of Edinburgh School of Law
              </h3>
              <p class="resume-role">Bachelor of Law (LLB)</p>
            </div>
            <time class="resume-date">2011</time>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="resume-item">
          <div class="resume-item-header">
            <div class="resume-item-left">
              <h3 class="resume-company">Goucher College</h3>
              <p class="resume-role">BA, Philosophy &amp; Religious Studies</p>
            </div>
            <time class="resume-date">2009</time>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>

    </main>

    

    <script is:inline>
      document.getElementById('download-resume').addEventListener('click', function() {
        const markdown = `# Thomas F. Officer

Lee, New Hampshire
thomas.officer@gmail.com | (603) 667-5760

## Experience

### Echo
**Cofounder, Designer** | 2023—2025

- Designed and shipped an AI-powered notebook for writers across web, iOS, Apple Watch, macOS, and MCP.
- Conducted user research and implemented an AI-driven process for synthesizing that research into product decisions.
- Used AI to move directly from product concept to production-ready pull requests, skipping traditional Figma prototypes.

### NetDocuments
**Principal Product Designer** | 2021—2023

- Led the integration of Afterpattern in NetDocuments, a mature, legacy codebase.
- Participated in early internal discussions around AI integration following the release of ChatGPT.
- Helped launch the company's first shared UI component library.

### Afterpattern
**Cofounder, Designer** | 2016—2021

- Led product design from initial concept through acquisition by NetDocuments.
- Led front-end development across web and the Microsoft Word add-in.
- Led user research and contributed to product strategy and roadmap as a cofounder.

### Blue Ridge Labs @ Robin Hood
**Design Fellow** | 2016

- Led user research studying how low-income New Yorkers navigate legal problems.
- Cofounded Afterpattern based on insights uncovered during the fellowship.

## Education & Certificates

### How to Build an AI Chatbot
**Every.to** | 2023

### VR & AR Design
**MIT xPRO** | 2023

### UX Apprenticeship
**Thinkful** | 2016

### Vermont Law School
**Master of Laws (LLM), Magna Cum Laude** | 2012

### University of Edinburgh School of Law
**Bachelor of Law (LLB)** | 2011

### Goucher College
**BA, Philosophy & Religious Studies** | 2009
`;

        const blob = new Blob([markdown], { type: 'text/markdown' });
        const url = URL.createObjectURL(blob);
        const a = document.createElement('a');
        a.href = url;
        a.download = 'thomas-f-officer-resume.md';
        document.body.appendChild(a);
        a.click();
        document.body.removeChild(a);
        URL.revokeObjectURL(url);
      });
    </script>
  
</BaseLayout>
